{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-17_beg","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-17","title":"直指命運","storyCode":"11-19","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-17_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e5b50da1f0b0d2670197dbbbd5507eb918b831ab30d9f279449fa58d0f896a5c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"最後的蒸汽騎士自墳墓深處站起，向所有試圖奪取維多利亞的仇敵發起衝鋒。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g10_kingrestcore"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，快看前面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這難道是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......蒸汽甲胄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在漆黑甲胄的映襯下，從氣孔處往外冒的白色蒸汽格外明顯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一下，又一下。\n就像呼吸一般。\n他正撥開迷霧，他正從歷史中甦醒。\n沒有什麼可以阻礙他，沒有什麼可以戰勝他。\n拋棄不能，背叛不能。\n就連死亡也不能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它動了，快看，它動起來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*維多利亞粗口*這到底是怎麼回事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，弩箭根本沒用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，準備榴彈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的甲胄從滿地殘骸中起立。\n沉重的腳步聲。\n沉悶的噴氣聲。\n它一步一步，走向慌亂的人們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“蒸汽甲胄”","speakerId":"avg_npc_651_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉悶的噴氣聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鉛踝，你出生在薩爾貢，你不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我小時候，我的睡前故事裡就是他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今我哄我孩子睡覺時，講的還是蒸汽騎士的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想讓我們戰勝他？我們怎麼可能戰勝他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們怎麼可能戰勝我們的驕傲，我們的榮光，我們的已經被背叛過一次的英雄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不可能戰勝他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......維多利亞的蒸汽騎士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"散開，散開！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......什麼聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噴氣聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定是噴氣聲，他們回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老子沒跟錯人！維娜原來把她的後手藏在這裡呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，我們的隊伍裡有蒸汽騎士了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆真的還有蒸汽騎士？他們就在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是在守著諸王長眠之所，守著......諸王之息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，管他們之前在幹什麼呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜可是他們的王！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我們和蒸汽騎士一起衝到地面上，那些薩卡茲一定......一定......呃，摩根，你的表情為什麼看起來這麼奇怪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜準備把諸王之息帶出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四年了。整整四年時間，蒸汽騎士藏身在這暗無天日的地底，沒有離開那把劍半步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲佔領城市他們沒有出現，薩卡茲接管工廠他們沒有出現，薩卡茲一把火燒了貴族們的宅子，他們也沒有出現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們到底在想什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，他們會與......諸王長眠之所的闖入者站在同一邊嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，是誰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......摩根，握緊武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......很強。他們一直潛伏在我們周圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，不錯，有點意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"諾伯特區的混混怎麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是亞歷山德莉娜手下的那個格拉斯哥幫嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別藏在暗處嘀嘀咕咕，給老子滾出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，變數已經夠多了，那噴氣聲居然在倫蒂尼姆再度響起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"公爵大人要是知道還有蒸汽騎士倖存，她會作何感想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她會不安嗎？還是欣慰於那些以榮光為氅的英雄們再度歸來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，榮光......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先讓我們解決這幾個混混吧，別讓她們妨礙阿勒黛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g10_kingrestcore"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“蒸汽甲胄”","speakerId":"avg_npc_651_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉悶的噴氣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......蒸汽騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四年過去了......蒸汽騎士之中，竟然還有倖存者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些傷痕......明明都是致命傷，薩卡茲的長釘幾乎摧毀了每一具甲胄的核心，裡面的人也沒有生還的可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，沒有王室鑰匙，沒人能進出諸王長眠之所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他就這樣，被關在這幽暗的地下，整整四年......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便他當時僥倖逃過一劫，他又是怎麼在這個地方活下來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盔甲之下的那個人......如今的他會是什麼樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“蒸汽甲胄”","speakerId":"avg_npc_651_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉悶的噴氣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是......誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......你是......什麼？"},{"type":"narration","text":"火光自甲胄的頭盔中亮起。\n阿勒黛感覺到，一道冰冷的視線正在注視著自己。\n注視著在場的所有人。\n火光......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"那具在火焰中咆哮的古老鎧甲。\n那是她年幼時想成為的理想。\n那是她曾把獲救寄託於上的希望。\n那是她親眼目睹的毀滅。\n那是她無法直視的夢魘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"他又回來了，他就站在自己面前。\n阿勒黛無法抑制自己的顫抖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......來清算這一切的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“蒸汽甲胄”","speakerId":"avg_npc_651_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉悶的噴氣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i12"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒸汽騎士，我是阿斯蘭王的後裔，我的名字是亞歷山德莉娜·維娜·維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下你的攻擊，騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們並非敵人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“蒸汽甲胄”","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i12"},{"type":"narration","text":"推進之王聽到一個聲音從自己頭頂響起。\n是蒸汽騎士在說話嗎？她不是很確定。那聲音並不像人類的聲音，反而更像機器的轟鳴。\n濃白色的蒸汽再次噴吐到他們面前，比之前頻率更快，也更加猛烈。\n漆黑的騎士朝她舉起了巨大的武器。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i12"},{"type":"narration","text":"“維多利亞。”\n推進之王突然明白過來，眼前的蒸汽騎士在呼喊著的並非她的姓氏。\n他在看著的是她手中的劍。\n諸王之息，維多利亞王權的象徵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“最後的蒸汽騎士”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“維多利亞。”"},{"type":"narration","text":"他將這把劍稱作維多利亞。\n他誓死守衛的維多利亞。\n他被宏大的維多利亞背叛，那麼，他就去守衛象徵的維多利亞。\n帝國最後的騎士，將向所有試圖奪取維多利亞的仇敵復仇。\n他向王位繼承人發起衝鋒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g10_kingrestcore"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，快躲開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒸汽騎士怎麼會攻擊你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他難道看不出來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趴下——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那把劍......火焰組成的刀刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別被它碰到！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瘋了，它瘋了！我們根本就不可能攔住它！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快撤吧，離開這裡......離開......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不了多久，他就能把我們全都幹掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶著你的人衝出去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......照維娜說的做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，任務取消。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士小姐，看來我的退休計劃要延遲了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達格達，你跟著雇傭兵離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是最後一個向他們行過禮的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你理應將他們的故事帶回陽光下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是屬於我們所有人的故事，推進之王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它應該由我們每一個人訴說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛，我不知道你在發什麼瘋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，你曾是我崇敬的那種人。我原以為，你配得上騎士的榮耀。不，你甚至是我想像中的那種“騎士的標杆”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身先士卒，不圖名利，永遠不會畏懼自己的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可是永遠高潔的坎伯蘭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼永遠高潔，達格達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們依然並肩作戰過，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡也有你的故事，阿勒黛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果你仍然願意回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......已經不可能了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許，這取決於你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我們現在......還是先面對眼前的騎士吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士間的戰鬥要公平且榮耀，這是我的導師教給我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鑑於對手是這麼一位遍灑榮光的英雄......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，請允許我同您並肩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰鬥......與他戰鬥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個可悲的，醜陋的，欺騙了一切的叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼敢於挑戰命運？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，這是一個絕好的寓言，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個純真的孩子想成為英雄，然而她變壞了，當她再度面對從歷史中歸來的英雄，發現英雄的劍指向了自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的死正應該是這個故事的結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她理應被剝奪一切，她甚至連僅剩的使命都無法完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想聽到你再提起“使命”這個詞了，阿勒黛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抬起頭來，阿勒黛·坎伯蘭。沒有什麼是我的使命，也沒有什麼是你的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得先讓他安靜下來，然後如果你還想拿這把劍，你可以向我發起挑戰，我會回應你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是你的該死的使命，阿勒黛，如果你想這麼做，你就去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但別把這個詞掛在嘴邊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“最後的蒸汽騎士”","speakerId":"avg_npc_651_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉悶的噴氣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，他來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
